#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "Downloading Gedit"
msgstr "Baixando Gedit"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You will need to download all of <application>Gedit's</application> "
"dependencies and the main package itself. Create lists of files to be "
"downloaded. The files will also be used to verify the integrity of the "
"downloads when complete:"
msgstr ""
"Você precisará baixar todas as dependências do "
"<application>Gedit</application> e o pacote principal em si. Crie listas de "
"arquivos para serem baixados. Os arquivos também serão usados para verificar"
" a integridade das transferências quando concluídas:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; gedit-data.md5 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># md5sum                         base-name     version \n"
"&libgedit-amtk-md5sum; amtk          &libgedit-amtk-version;\n"
"&libgedit-gtksourceview-md5sum; gtksourceview &libgedit-gtksourceview-version;\n"
"&libgedit-gfls-md5sum; gfls          &libgedit-gfls-version;\n"
"&libgedit-tepl-md5sum; tepl          &libgedit-tepl-version;\n"
"&gedit-md5sum; gedit         &gedit-version;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; gedit-data.md5 &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># md5sum                         base-name     version \n"
"&libgedit-amtk-md5sum; amtk          &libgedit-amtk-version;\n"
"&libgedit-gtksourceview-md5sum; gtksourceview &libgedit-gtksourceview-version;\n"
"&libgedit-gfls-md5sum; gfls          &libgedit-gfls-version;\n"
"&libgedit-tepl-md5sum; tepl          &libgedit-tepl-version;\n"
"&gedit-md5sum; gedit         &gedit-version;</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To download the needed files using <xref linkend='wget'/>, use the following"
" commands:"
msgstr ""
"Para baixar os arquivos necessários usando o <xref linkend='wget'/>, use os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p gedit-pkgs &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd       gedit-pkgs &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -rf *\n"
"\n"
"while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"  # Skip blank lines or lines beginning with a hash (#) character.\n"
"  if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"\n"
"  # Parse the input line into local variables.\n"
"  IFS=\" \" read -r md5 name ver &lt;&lt;&lt; \"$line\"\n"
"\n"
"  if [ $name = \"gedit\" ]; then\n"
"    maj_ver=$(echo $ver | cut -d\".\" -f1)\n"
"    filename=gedit-$ver.tar.xz\n"
"    url=\"https://download.gnome.org/sources/gedit/$maj_ver/$filename\"\n"
"  else\n"
"    filename=libgedit-$name-$ver.tar.bz2\n"
"    url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/gedit/libgedit-$name/-/archive/$ver/$filename\"\n"
"  fi\n"
"\n"
"  wget $url 2&gt;/dev/null\n"
"\n"
"  echo \"$md5 $filename\" | md5sum -c\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; ../gedit-data.md5</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -p gedit-pkgs &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd       gedit-pkgs &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"rm -rf *\n"
"\n"
"while read -r line; do\n"
"\n"
"  # Skip blank lines or lines beginning with a hash (#) character.\n"
"  if $(echo $line | grep -E -q '^ *$|^#' ); then continue; fi\n"
"\n"
"  # Parse the input line into local variables.\n"
"  IFS=\" \" read -r md5 name ver &lt;&lt;&lt; \"$line\"\n"
"\n"
"  if [ $name = \"gedit\" ]; then\n"
"    maj_ver=$(echo $ver | cut -d\".\" -f1)\n"
"    filename=gedit-$ver.tar.xz\n"
"    url=\"https://download.gnome.org/sources/gedit/$maj_ver/$filename\"\n"
"  else\n"
"    filename=libgedit-$name-$ver.tar.bz2\n"
"    url=\"https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/gedit/libgedit-$name/-/archive/$ver/$filename\"\n"
"  fi\n"
"\n"
"  wget $url 2&gt;/dev/null\n"
"\n"
"  echo \"$md5 $filename\" | md5sum -c\n"
"\n"
"done &lt; ../gedit-data.md5</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Gedit"
msgstr "Instalação do Gedit"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"All of the packages come with a test suite. If you wish to execute them, "
"either comment out the <command>rm -rf ...</command> below, so that, after "
"all the packages are installed, you can come back to the corresponding "
"directory and run <command>ninja test</command>, or do individual builds, "
"running the tests for each of the packages.  Alternatively, you can "
"uncomment the line #<command>ninja test ...</command>, and at the end, check"
" the test results with:"
msgstr ""
"Todos os pacotes vem com uma suíte de teste. Se você desejar executá-los, "
"comente o <command>rm -rf ...</command> abaixo, de forma que, depois que "
"todos os pacotes forem instalados, você possa voltar ao diretório "
"correspondente e executar <command>ninja test</command>, ou faça construções"
" individuais, executando os testes para cada um dos pacotes. "
"Alternativamente, você pode descomentar a linha #<command>ninja test "
"...</command>, e no final, verificar os resultados do teste com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:178
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>grep -A9 summary *ninja_test.log</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>grep -A9 summary *ninja_test.log</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:181
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Libgedit-amtk's</application> test-action-map test is known to "
"fail."
msgstr ""
"O teste test-action-map do <application>Libgedit-amtk</application> é "
"conhecido por falhar."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid "First, start a subshell that will exit on error:"
msgstr "Primeiro, inicie um sub shell que sairá em caso de erro:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:189
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>bash -e</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The order of builds is important.  Install <application>Gedit</application> "
"and its dependencies by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"A ordem das construções é importante. Instale "
"<application>Gedit</application> e s dependências dele executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:197
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>for package in *amtk* *gtk* *gfls* *tepl* gedit*\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"\n"
"  echo \"Building $packagedir\"\n"
"    tar -xf $package\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"      cd build\n"
"\n"
"      meson setup ..            \\\n"
"            --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false \n"
"      ninja\n"
"\n"
"      #ninja test 2>&amp;1 | tee ../../$packagedir-ninja_test.log\n"
"  \n"
"      as_root ninja install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>for package in *amtk* *gtk* *gfls* *tepl* gedit*\n"
"do\n"
"  packagedir=${package%.tar.?z*}\n"
"\n"
"  echo \"Building $packagedir\"\n"
"    tar -xf $package\n"
"    pushd $packagedir\n"
"      cd build\n"
"\n"
"      meson setup ..            \\\n"
"            --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -D gtk_doc=false \n"
"      ninja\n"
"\n"
"      #ninja test 2>&amp;1 | tee ../../$packagedir-ninja_test.log\n"
"  \n"
"      as_root ninja install\n"
"    popd\n"
"\n"
"  rm -rf $packagedir\n"
"done</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:221
#, xml-text
msgid "Finally, exit the shell that was started earlier:"
msgstr "Finalmente, saia do shell que foi iniciado anteriormente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/editors/gedit.xml:224
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>exit</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>exit</userinput>"

